<title>JAPAN: Hodogaya Chemical up on positive earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Hodogaya Chemical up on positive earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hodogaya Chemical Co Ltd were higher in Monday afternoon trading, helped by a positive earnings forecast, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0354 GMT, the shares were up 12 yen at 487 yen.</p>
<p>On Friday the chemical maker, which is affiliated with Tosoh Corp, said that it expected to post a parent current profit of 200 million yen in the year to March 31, 1997 after posting a loss in the previous year.</p>
